@@ -3,3 +3,18 @@
 The Lakeside Windsurf School teaches windsurfing on the lake from April to October, and rents boards and
 sails to its students and to visitors who bring their own experience. This repository holds the software
 of its booking desk, written in TypeScript with no runtime dependency.
+
+## Rental module
+
+`createRentalService()` (exported from `src/index.ts`) returns an in-memory service:
+
+- `addEquipment({ id, kind, dailyPrice })` — `kind` is `'board'` or `'sail'`; `dailyPrice` is an integer in euro cents.
+- `quote({ itemId, start, end })` — returns `{ itemId, start, end, total }`.
+- `book({ itemId, start, end })` — returns `{ id, itemId, start, end, total }`; throws if the item is not free.
+
+Rules: money in integer euro cents; times are ISO-8601 UTC strings; a period covers whole days, so `start` and
+`end` are midnight UTC and `end` (exclusive) is the start of the day after the last day; the same item cannot be
+booked for overlapping periods. Booking ids are sequential (`booking-1`, …) so behaviour is deterministic.
+The cancellation policy (no refund under 24 hours before start, otherwise full refund) is not implemented yet.
+
+Run the tests with `npm test` (Node 22.18+, which runs TypeScript directly).
